<!-- l4: decide:Example Award State Active -->

**64.** Example Award State Active means CEO Award State where Musk Service Status is Chief Executive Officer, Current Date is Grant Date, Performance Metrics is Example Metrics High Performance, Earned Tranches is EMPTY, Earned Dates is EMPTY, CEO Succession Framework is TRUE, Termination Reason is NOTHING, Covered Event Occurred is FALSE, Covered Event Type is NOTHING, HSR Waiting Period Expired is TRUE and Shareholder Approval Received is TRUE.

<!-- l4: decide:Example Award State Terminated -->

**65.** Example Award State Terminated means CEO Award State where Musk Service Status is Not In Eligible Service, Current Date is years after with 2 and Grant Date, Performance Metrics is Example Metrics High Performance, Earned Tranches is list of 1 and 2, Earned Dates is list of years after with 1 and Grant Date and Date with the sum of Grant Date and 500, CEO Succession Framework is TRUE, Termination Reason is JUST with Without Cause, Covered Event Occurred is FALSE, Covered Event Type is NOTHING, HSR Waiting Period Expired is TRUE and Shareholder Approval Received is TRUE.

<!-- l4: decide:Example Award State Change In Control -->

**66.** Example Award State Change In Control means CEO Award State where Musk Service Status is Chief Executive Officer, Current Date is Date with years after with 2 and Grant Date, Performance Metrics is Example Metrics High Performance, Earned Tranches is list of 1, Earned Dates is list of years after with 1 and Grant Date, CEO Succession Framework is TRUE, Termination Reason is JUST with Change In Control, Covered Event Occurred is FALSE, Covered Event Type is NOTHING, HSR Waiting Period Expired is TRUE and Shareholder Approval Received is TRUE.

<!-- l4: decide:Example Award State Medium Performance -->

**67.** Example Award State Medium Performance means CEO Award State where Musk Service Status is Chief Executive Officer, Current Date is Grant Date, Performance Metrics is Example Metrics Medium Performance, Earned Tranches is EMPTY, Earned Dates is EMPTY, CEO Succession Framework is TRUE, Termination Reason is NOTHING, Covered Event Occurred is FALSE, Covered Event Type is NOTHING, HSR Waiting Period Expired is TRUE and Shareholder Approval Received is TRUE.

<!-- l4: decide:Example Award State Low Performance -->

**68.** Example Award State Low Performance means CEO Award State where Musk Service Status is Chief Executive Officer, Current Date is Grant Date, Performance Metrics is Example Metrics Low Performance, Earned Tranches is EMPTY, Earned Dates is EMPTY, CEO Succession Framework is FALSE, Termination Reason is NOTHING, Covered Event Occurred is FALSE, Covered Event Type is NOTHING, HSR Waiting Period Expired is TRUE and Shareholder Approval Received is TRUE.

## Testing

<!-- l4: decide:Example Award State With Earned Tranche -->

**69.** Example Award State With Earned Tranche means CEO Award State where Musk Service Status is Chief Executive Officer, Current Date is Seventh And Half Anniversary, Performance Metrics is Example Metrics High Performance, Earned Tranches is list of 1, Earned Dates is list of Fifth Anniversary, CEO Succession Framework is TRUE, Termination Reason is NOTHING, Covered Event Occurred is FALSE, Covered Event Type is NOTHING, HSR Waiting Period Expired is TRUE and Shareholder Approval Received is TRUE.

